---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

import SeoPage from "@/components/SeoPage.astro";

const lastUpdated = "April 12, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <SeoPage
    slot="head"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    description="Privacy policy for personal tools and integrations operated by Varant Avanesyan."
  />
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert mt-8 max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

    <p>
      This privacy policy describes how personal tools and integrations
      operated by Varant Avanesyan ("I", "me") handle information. These tools
      are personal projects intended for my own use and are not offered as
      services to the public.
    </p>

    <h2>Information collected</h2>
    <p>
      My personal tools do not collect, store, sell, or share personal
      information from third parties. Some integrations authenticate against
      third-party platforms (such as TikTok) using OAuth in order to act on my
      own accounts. In those cases, access tokens issued by the third-party
      platform are stored locally on devices I control and are used solely to
      perform actions I have authorized on my own accounts.
    </p>

    <h2>Use of third-party APIs</h2>
    <p>
      Where my tools interact with third-party APIs (for example, the TikTok
      Content Posting API), they do so only on behalf of accounts I own and
      operate. No data belonging to other users is accessed, stored, or
      processed.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Authentication tokens and any associated metadata are retained only for
      as long as needed to operate the tool, and are deleted when no longer
      required. Tokens can be revoked at any time through the relevant
      third-party platform's settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not use cookies or tracking technologies for
      advertising or analytics profiling.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this policy, contact me through the links on the
      <a href="/">homepage</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
